 *   38-M  OCR controls, progress bar + textarea
 *   38-N  PDF options (selects row + quality slider wrapper)
 *   38-O  Export + Danger full-width cam buttons
 *   38-P  Info section — privacy feature list + tech grid + pro tip
 *   38-Q  Step number badge (for workflow guide)
