 *  41-I  EXIF note             (.pct-exif-note)
 *  41-J  Canvas workspace      (.pct-canvas-wrapper / toolbar / scroll)
 *  41-K  Toolbar buttons       (.pct-tb-btn)
 *  41-L  Brush cursor overlay  (.pct-brush-cursor)
 *  41-M  Processing overlay    (.pct-canvas-overlay / .pct-spinner / .pct-ring)
